errors_directives.orbit:1:6: server:defer only works on .orbit components
errors_directives.orbit:2:7: server:defer only works on .orbit components
errors_directives.orbit:3:11: server:defer only works on .orbit components
errors_directives.orbit:4:7: server:defer takes no value
errors_directives.orbit:7:3: only slot="fallback" content is allowed inside a server:defer component
errors_directives.orbit:8:3: only slot="fallback" content is allowed inside a server:defer component
errors_directives.orbit:11:3: only slot="fallback" content is allowed inside a server:defer component
errors_directives.orbit:13:6: client:visible only works on .orbit components; move the <script> into a component
errors_directives.orbit:14:7: client:idle only works on .orbit components; move the <script> into a component
errors_directives.orbit:15:11: client:load only works on .orbit components; move the <script> into a component
errors_directives.orbit:16:7: client:visible takes a static string value, not an expression
errors_directives.orbit:17:7: client:media takes a static string value, not an expression
errors_directives.orbit:18:7: client:idle takes no value
errors_directives.orbit:19:7: client:load takes no value
errors_directives.orbit:20:7: client:media needs a media query, e.g. client:media="(max-width: 600px)"
errors_directives.orbit:21:7: client:media needs a media query, e.g. client:media="(max-width: 600px)"
errors_directives.orbit:22:19: only one client:* directive is allowed per component
errors_directives.orbit:23:7: client:only is for framework components, which Orbit doesn't support; use client:load, client:idle, client:visible or client:media
errors_directives.orbit:24:7: unknown directive "client:hover" (client directives: client:load, client:idle, client:visible, client:media)
errors_directives.orbit:25:7: unknown directive "server:lazy" (server directives: server:defer)
errors_directives.orbit:26:7: server:defer and client:* can't be combined; put client:* on a component inside the deferred one
errors_directives.orbit:27:7: server:defer and client:* can't be combined; put client:* on a component inside the deferred one
errors_directives.orbit:28:6: class:list isn't supported; build the class string in the frontmatter (e.g. strings.Join)
errors_directives.orbit:28:27: define:vars isn't supported; pass data with data-* attributes or set:json
errors_directives.orbit:29:6: unknown directive "set:foo" (set directives: set:html, set:text, set:json)
errors_directives.orbit:29:18: unknown directive "is:raw" (is directives: is:inline, is:global)
errors_directives.orbit:31:7: server:defer and client:* can't be combined; put client:* on a component inside the deferred one
